        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2014 Race of Champions, Nations' Cup, individual contest, 24 Hours of Le Mans\n- People: Tom Kristensen, Petter Solberg, David Coulthard, Pascal Wehrlein\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Kristensen won six consecutive 24 Hours of Le Mans races from 2000 to 2005.\n- Tom Kristensen holds the record for the most 24 Hours of Le Mans wins with nine victories.\n- At the 2014 Race of Champions, the Nordic team of Tom Kristensen and Petter Solberg won the Nations' Cup.\n- At the 2014 Race of Champions, David Coulthard won the individual contest by defeating Pascal Wehrlein 2–0 in the final.",
